{"title": "Disarming", "pageid": 21544, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Disarming", "categories": ["Gameplay mechanics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Disarming</b> is an  action that, when taken, can force the target to drop their <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon\">weapon</a>.\n</p><p>The following methods of disarming exist in the game:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disarming_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Disarming Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/45px-Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disarming Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Disarming_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disarming_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Disarming Attack (Melee)\">Disarming Attack (Melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disarming_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Disarming Attack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/45px-Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Disarming_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disarming Attack (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Disarming_A